# Training stimulus

The screen title is Estimated training stimulus. The file remains `ConditioningAdaptationsScreen.tsx`.

The current v1 model reports four overlapping axes in raw units. Calibrated comparisons need a compatible prior test and modality. Assault Bike comparisons also need the same machine and technique. Legacy `heuristic-v0.1` snapshot fields remain readable as historical data.

Use measured or explicitly reported actual durations. Expose observed details independently, and label missing-data fallbacks, known subtotals and coverage. Avoid deriving output or duration from targets.

The Home timeline keeps `timelineCategories.conditioning.color`. See `docs/training-stimulus-and-indices-v1.md` for the model and thresholds.
